{"id":42807,"date":"2025-06-24T11:41:21","date_gmt":"2025-06-24T10:41:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=42807"},"modified":"2026-08-21T00:02:34","modified_gmt":"2026-08-20T23:02:34","slug":"sintra-trail-monte-da-lua-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sintra-trail-monte-da-lua-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Sintra Trail Monte da Lua 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"pr-expired-notice\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<\/span><div><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\">Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o j\u00e1 decorreu.<\/strong><p style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #CBD5E1; margin: 2px 0 0 0;\">Consulta os resultados desta prova abaixo ou acede a todos os detalhes da edi\u00e7\u00e3o atual.<\/p><\/div><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sintra-trail-monte-da-lua\/\" style=\"background: #8B5CF6 !important; color: #FFFFFF !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 13.5px !important; text-decoration: none !important; padding: 11px 22px !important; border-radius: 10px !important; white-space: nowrap !important; display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: center !important; height: 42px !important; margin: 0 !important; border: none !important; line-height: 1 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4) !important;\">Ver Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Atual &rarr;<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A&nbsp;<strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sintra<\/strong>&nbsp;organiza a&nbsp;<strong>11 de julho de 2025, pelas 21h00<\/strong>, o&nbsp;<strong>Sintra Trail Monte da Lua<\/strong>. A quarta edi\u00e7\u00e3o do evento \u00e9 composta por uma prova de corrida e duas caminhadas:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>Trail de 10 Km<\/strong>, com car\u00e1ter competitivo<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>Caminhada Longa 10 Km<\/strong>, de car\u00e1ter l\u00fadico-desportivo<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>Caminhada Familiar 5 Km<\/strong>, de car\u00e1ter l\u00fadico-desportivo<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Todas as provas t\u00eam como local de partida o Largo Rainha D. Am\u00e9lia, junto ao Pal\u00e1cio Nacional de Sintra. Os percursos do SINTRA TRAIL Monte da Lua s\u00e3o essencialmente urbanos, utilizando ruas, vielas, escadas, tuneis, monumentos, jardins, miradouros, pontes e trilhos. O Sintra Trail Monte da Lua \u00e9 maioritariamente um Trail urbano.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":42808,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[33,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-42807","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sintra-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/495868793_1289237336539868_210930762915667736_n.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/42807","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/w